https://www.booking.com/hotel/jp/sanmi-tsutenkaku-502-5min-to-ebisucho-sta-10min-to-namba-dotonbori-45min-to-kix.es.html</description><styleUrl>#s_alojamiento</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>135.50566,34.6556,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Alojamiento Kioto (Mibu, Nakagyo-ku - RESERVA cancelable)</name><description>Ciudad: Kioto
Zona: Mibu-Amagaike 35-53, Nakagyo-ku
